    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.dfki.de/lt/onto/intuitiv/indoor#Landmark">
        <rdfs:comment>Examples; A red building at the intersection of roads has the affordance of land-mark.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>



